{"slug":"postpartum-psychosocial-adaptation","title":"產後心理調適與親子依附","subtitle":"Postpartum psychosocial adaptation — Rubin's taking-in, taking-hold and letting-go phases, maternal role attainment, postpartum stress in Taiwanese mothers, bonding and attachment (touch progression, claiming, reciprocity), early skin-to-skin contact and rooming-in, fathers' engrossment, sibling adjustment, warning signs of poor adaptation and therapeutic communication","category":"care","aliases":["產後心理調適","產後心理變化","產後心理","Postpartum psychological adaptation","Rubin","魯賓","接受期","Taking-in phase","緊執期","掌握期","Taking-hold phase","放手期","釋放期","Letting-go phase","母性角色獲得","母職角色","Maternal role attainment","產後壓力","親子依附","依附","Attachment","親子連結","Bonding","依附行為","觸摸順序","指尖觸摸","認同行為","Claiming","宣稱","互惠期","Reciprocity","同步","Synchrony","情緒共生","分離個別化","早期肌膚接觸","親子同室","Rooming-in","父親依附","全神貫注","Engrossment","準父親","新手爸爸","手足競爭","手足適應","Sibling rivalry","退化行為","依附不良","適應不良徵兆"],"dzTags":["手足競爭"],"admTags":[],"system":"obstetrics","alsoIn":["psychiatric"],"group":"perinatal-care","reviewed":false,"updated":"2026-10-27","references":[{"title":"華杏《產科護理學》第 12 章第二節 產後期婦女的心理調適(書頁 472–477)、第八節 親子依附、角色調適與家庭適應(書頁 586–597)","note":"僅作為撰寫參考，本頁文字與表格為重新整理撰寫；產後壓力研究引自課本整理的 Hung(2005、2007)"},{"title":"Rubin R. Puerperal change. Nurs Outlook 1961;9:753–755","note":"產後接受期、緊執期、放手期"},{"title":"Klaus MH, Kennell JH. Maternal-Infant Bonding(1976)","note":"早期接觸與親子連結概念"},{"title":"Greenberg M, Morris N. Engrossment：the newborn's impact upon the father. Am J Orthopsychiatry 1974;44(4):520–531","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1939-0025.1974.tb00906.x","note":"父親的全神貫注(engrossment)"},{"title":"國考歷屆題與 AI 詳解","note":"只用來判斷考點"}],"chapters":["產科-Ch08產後期之護理 > 產後心理調適"],"intro":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"產後婦女同時面對身體復原、新的母親角色與家庭關係改變，產後期本身就是壓力情境。本頁依「Rubin 三期 → 母性角色與產後壓力 → 親子依附 → 促進依附的措施（肌膚接觸、親子同室） → 父親 → 手足 → 適應不良的徵兆與溝通」排列。懷孕期的心理與 Rubin 四項母性任務見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"maternal-adaptation#psychological"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"各孕期的心理反應"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"maternal-adaptation#rubin-tasks"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rubin 的母性任務"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；產後情緒低落、產後憂鬱與產後精神病見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"postpartum-complications#postpartum-mood"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"產後情緒障礙"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"depressive-disorder#postpartum"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"產後情緒障礙"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；肌膚接觸的做法見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"breastfeeding#ten-steps"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"成功哺餵母乳十措施與肌膚接觸"}]}]}]},"sections":[{"id":"summary","depth":2,"number":"一、","title":"重點摘要","children":[{"id":"exam-points","depth":3,"number":"(一)","title":"國考常考點","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"接受期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"行為：注意力集中在"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"自己"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、重述生產經過（「昨晚一直夢到我如何生小孩」「生小孩好痛，下次再也不要生了」）、說很累不想餵奶；不是主動關心新生兒或積極尋求意見"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"產後第二天宮縮痛、睡不好、拒絕餵奶 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"接受期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"先滿足她的需求，同時鼓勵多接觸新生兒"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；不是因為第二胎沒興趣，也不是宮縮痛異常"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"產後 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3–10 天"}]},{"type":"text","value":"注意母職學習與身體功能恢復 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"緊執期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(taking-hold)；產後第 3 天主動學嬰兒沐浴 → 緊執期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"緊執期是「"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"介於依賴與獨立之間"}]},{"type":"text","value":"」的時期；「話多、喜歡談論生產過程」是接受期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"剖腹產想和新生兒相處：產檯上即可肌膚接觸、建議 24 小時親子同室；"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"產婦疲憊想休息時仍堅持親子同室"}]},{"type":"text","value":"是錯的"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"親子同室"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"正確"}]},{"type":"text","value":"：母親非常疲憊時可把嬰兒推回嬰兒室；"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不是"}]},{"type":"text","value":"出生 6 小時後才開始、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不是"}]},{"type":"text","value":"禁止祖父母接觸、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不是"}]},{"type":"text","value":"趴睡；"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不是只有餵母乳的媽媽"}]},{"type":"text","value":"才能親子同室；讓較大的兄姊撫摸新生兒是適當的"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"依附關係"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"錯誤"}]},{"type":"text","value":"敘述：「除了"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"兩歲以下"}]},{"type":"text","value":"的小孩外，鼓勵所有家人參與」（兩歲以下也要）"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"大寶 2 歲、媽媽擔心照顧兩個孩子：最需要追蹤的是「"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"除了哺餵，其他時間都請月嫂照顧"}]},{"type":"text","value":"」（依附不足）"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"父親凝視寶寶並說「我是爸爸」→ "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"全神貫注"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（英文 engrossment；題目選項寫成 engorgement）"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"新手爸爸不敢抱："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"循序漸進，先撫觸再教抱"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"最無助於父親建立依附："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"詢問新生兒血型"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；陪哺乳、說話、換尿布都有幫助"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"「妹妹跟爸爸長得好像」→ "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"認同行為"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(claiming)"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"進入"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"互惠期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"：母親能"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"了解新生兒的飢餓與飽足行為"}]},{"type":"text","value":"並回應；用手指觸摸臉頰是最早的接觸"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第一天仔細觀察新生兒並詢問外觀 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"給她充分時間認識和熟悉新生兒"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"母嬰親善十措施中"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"直接"}]},{"type":"text","value":"促進依附的是"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"產後立即肌膚接觸"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Apgar 7、8 分、正在縫會陰 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"立即"}]},{"type":"text","value":"把新生兒放在母親胸腹部肌膚接觸，不用等縫完或送嬰兒室"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"產後立即肌膚接觸：新生兒直接放在"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"乳房上"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、讓新生兒"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"用手觸摸乳頭"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（兩者都給分）；不是 1 小時後才做、不是硬把乳房塞進嘴裡"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"潛在適應不良：看寶寶時"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"皺眉哭著說「他看起來好可怕」"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；和朋友談生產過程、撫摸頭部腫塊、輕聲說話都是正常"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"寶寶照光住院、媽媽覺得自己不是好媽媽："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不適當"}]},{"type":"text","value":"的是「為避免感染不鼓勵探訪」"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第四胎又生女兒、家人不來 → 「"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"聽起來妳很難過……妳現在的想法是？"}]},{"type":"text","value":"」（同理＋開放式問句）"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"新住民產婦變胖變醜、先生要離台、擔心獨自照顧 → 身體心像改變、缺乏社會支持、照顧壓力；"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"「低自尊」較不恰當"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（沒有資料支持）"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}}],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rubin 產後三期："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"接受期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（第 1–2 天，以"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"自己"}]},{"type":"text","value":"為中心、被動依賴、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"重述分娩過程"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、要吃要睡） → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"緊執期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（第 3–10 天，介於依賴與獨立，"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"主動學習照顧嬰兒"}]},{"type":"text","value":"與自我照顧） → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"放手期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（放下理想中的分娩與嬰兒，接受"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"真實的嬰兒"}]},{"type":"text","value":"與新角色）"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"接受期先"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"滿足她的休息與飲食需求"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，同時鼓勵接觸嬰兒；緊執期是"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"衛教的最佳時機"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，多給肯定"}]},{"type":"text",